               remarkable web experiences. As a final year diploma student,\n                    I strive to deliver high-quality solutions that exceed\n                    expectations. Explore my portfolio to see my exceptional\n                    projects and collaborations. Let's collaborate to turn your\n                    vision into reality and create something amazing.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"main-container\">\n                    <div class=\"skills-container\">\n                        <span>Skills</span>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Web Development</h3>\n                            <div class=\"dot-container\">\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Custom Dashboard</h3>\n                            <div class=\"dot-container\">\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-empty\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>API Development</h3>\n                            <div class=\"dot-container\">\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-empty\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-empty\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Web Scraping</h3>\n                            <div class=\"dot-container\">\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-empty\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-empty\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Python</h3>\n                            <div class=\"dot-container\">\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-fill\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"dot dot-empty\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"achievements-container\">\n                        <span>Achievements</span>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Github Repositories</h3>\n                            <div class=\"digits\">8+</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Total Contributions</h3>\n                            <div class=\"digits\">70+</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Static Websites</h3>\n                            <div class=\"digits\">10+</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Dynamic Websites</h3>\n                            <div class=\"digits\">4+</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"box\">\n                            <h3>Python Utils</h3>\n                            <div class=\"digits\">3+</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center;\">\n                    <img\n                        src=\"https://github-profile-summary-cards.vercel.app/api/cards/profile-details?username=soham901&theme=dark\"\n                        alt=\"GitHub Profile Summary Card\"\n                    />\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- END : about section design -->\n\n        <!-- START : contact section design -->\n        <section class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\">\n            <h2 class=\"heading\">Contact <span>Me!</span></h2>\n            <form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xgebbybn\" method=\"post\">\n                <div class=\"input-box\">\n                    <input\n                        onkeyup=\"displayText(this);\"\n                        type=\"text\"\n                        name=\"name\"\n                        id=\"name\"\n                        required\n                        placeholder=\"Full Name\"\n                    />\n                    <input\n                        type=\"email\"\n                        name=\"email\"\n                        required\n                        placeholder=\"Email Address\"\n                    />\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"input-box\">\n                    <input\n                        type=\"number\"\n                        name=\"phone\"\n                        placeholder=\"Mobile Number\"\n                        id=\"mobileno\"\n                    />\n                    <input\n                        type=\"text\"\n                        name=\"subject\"\n                        required\n                        id=\"emailsub\"\n                        placeholder=\"Email Subject\"\n                    />\n                </div>\n                <textarea\n                    name=\"message\"\n                    id=\"\"\n                    cols=\"30\"\n                    rows=\"10\"\n                    required\n                    placeholder=\"Your Message\"\n                ></textarea>\n                <input type=\"submit\" value=\"Send Message\" class=\"so-btn\" />\n            </form>\n        </section>\n        <!-- END : contact section design -->\n\n        <!-- END : footer section design -->\n        <footer id=\"footer\" class=\"footer\">\n            <div class=\"footer-text\">\n                <p>\n                    Thank you for visiting my portfolio. Let's collaborate to\n                    turn your ideas into reality.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"footer-iconTop\">\n                <a href=\"#home\"><i class=\"bx bx-up-arrow-alt\"></i></a>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n        <!-- START : footer section design -->\n\n        <!-- START : JS Scripts -->\n        <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/typed.js@2.0.16/dist/typed.umd.js\"></script>\n\n        <script src=\"assets/js/main.js\"></script>\n\n        <!-- <script src=\"assets/js/animations.js\"></script> -->\n\n        <!-- Ads -->\n        <script async src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-8114308424702961\"      crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n\n        <!-- Setup and start animation! -->\n        <script>\n            var typed = new Typed(\"#element\", {\n                strings: [\n                    \"Frontend Developer\",\n                    \"Backend Developer\",\n                    \"API Developer\",\n                ],\n                typeSpeed: 46,\n                loop: true,\n                loopCount: Infinity,\n            });\n        </script>\n\n        <script>\n            function displayText(x) {\n                document.querySelector(\"#emailsub\").value =\n                    \"portfolio-contact : \" + x.value;\n            }\n        </script>\n        <!-- END : JS Scripts -->\n    </body>\n</html>\n",
